{
  "notice": {
    "notice_id": 351704,
    "notice_title": "关于发布《中央民族大学新一轮本科教育教学审核评估应知应会手册》的通知",
    "organization_name": "教务处（考试中心、教师教学发展中心）",
    "organization_id": "00011",
    "notice_release_time": "2025-08-29 22:58",
    "notice_create_time": "2025-08-28 22:53",
    "notice_first_time": "2025-08-28 22:53",
    "notice_content": "<p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">各部门、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">各单位、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">各位老师、各位同学：</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">学校将于</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">日正式迎接教育部新一轮本科教育教学审核评估。为切实做好迎评工作，便于广大师生员工了解掌握审核评估基础知识和学校本科教育教学情况，在全校上下形成“人人关心评估、人人了解评估、人人参与评估、人人支持评估”的浓厚氛围，教务处编制了《中央民族大学新一轮本科教育教学审核评估应知应会手册》。</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">请各单位组织师生认真学习，并结合本单位评建特色和亮点，加深师生对学校及各单位评建工作的认知。</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">附件：《中央民族大学新一轮本科教育教学审核评估应知应会手册》</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: right;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">教务处（考试中心、教师教学发展中心） &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&nbsp;2025</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">8</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">28</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">日 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
